e conducted there except for the individual show jumping final, which was held at the main Olympic Stadium, and the endurance course in eventing, which was held at Gyeong-ma Gyu-yug-won, or Wondang Ranch, 43 km north of Kwachon. All horses travelling to Korea had to spend 21 days in pre-flight quarantine, and on arrival in Seoul the horses stayed for 36 hours in quarantine at the Equestrian Park."] "\n\n" [:p {} "Team and individual eventing were contested at the 1988 Seoul Olympics, with both events held concurrently. New Zealand’s " [:a {:href ""} "Mark Todd"] " defended his gold medal in the individual title and West Germany took the team gold medal. Todd was the second eventer to defend an individual gold medal, after " [:a {:href ""} "Charles Pahud de Mortanges"] " in 1928-32."] "\n\n"] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "Events"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {} "Status"] "\n" [:th {} "Date"] "\n" [:th {} "Participants"] "\n" [:th {} "NOCs"] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/185361"} "Individual, Open"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "19 – 22 September 1988"] "\n" [:td {} "50"] "\n" [:td {} "16"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/185366"} "Team, Open"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "19 – 22 September 1988"] "\n" [:td {} "40"] "\n" [:td {} "10"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n50 (40/10)\n"] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n16 (16/6)\n"] "\n"] "\n"]] "\n\n\n" [:h2 {} "Medals"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {:class "top"} [:a {:href "/results/185361"} "Individual, Open"]] "\n" [:td {:style 